v.com/files/file/2756-ammo-stats-on-name/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Ammo Stats on Name</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>Ammo stats line wrapping:</strong> ammo stats now appear on a new line (only works with the “<strong>Show all ammo stats</strong>” feature)</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3><strong>Extract the BepInEx folder from the 7z archive to the game root directory. Profit!</strong></h3></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 3922, "published_at": "2025-07-23T21:23:36.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2221/ball-better-ammo-loading-list/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 7548, "downloads": 17634, "published_at": "2025-10-11T23:26:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2221/ball-better-ammo-loading-list/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.1", "content_length": 7539, "downloads": 2567, "published_at": "2026-08-01T16:48:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2221/ball-better-ammo-loading-list/1.1.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}], "repos": ["Katrin0522/SPT-BetterAmmoLoadingList"], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/Katrin0522/SPT-BetterAmmoLoadingList", "label": ""}], "required_by": 0, "no_repo": false, "obtainable": true, "dep_problems": 0}